  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "救场的泰语翻译  (Saving the Taping in Thai)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With the interpreter on the way to hospital and Wen Simo's schedule tight, Wen Simo's visiting friend unexpectedly steps in to interpret so the taping can finish smoothly. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "吓死我了，这可怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你不是在美国留学的吗？泰语也会说啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现在翻译没了，今天还怎么录啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "闻老师的档期也有限，你有什么办法吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "希望我们的中国观众能够早日看到您的这部新剧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "同时也希望米娜先生以后能有机会再来我们的节目做客。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "闻老师，内容都够了，您休息一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "咱们最后再录一个收尾就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "好的，辛苦了，你这个翻译很地道啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "他想去医院看朋友，已经帮他们安排好了车。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "吓死我了，这可怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That scared me half to death—what do we do now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你不是在美国留学的吗？泰语也会说啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not study abroad in America? You speak Thai as well?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现在翻译没了，今天还怎么录啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that our interpreter is gone, how can we finish taping today?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "闻老师的档期也有限，你有什么办法吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen Simo's schedule is tight too—do you have any way to help?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "希望我们的中国观众能够早日看到您的这部新剧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We hope our Chinese viewers will soon get to watch your new series.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "同时也希望米娜先生以后能有机会再来我们的节目做客。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At the same time, we hope Mr Mina will have the chance to visit our show again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "闻老师，内容都够了，您休息一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen Simo, we have enough material now—please take a breather.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "咱们最后再录一个收尾就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We just need to tape one closing wrap at the end.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "好的，辛苦了，你这个翻译很地道啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sounds good, thanks for the hard work—your Thai interpreting was spot-on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "他想去医院看朋友，已经帮他们安排好了车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Mina wants to visit his interpreter at the hospital, and we have arranged a car for them.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "吓死我了，这可怎么办？",
